ion.html", "date": "Apr 23, 2026", "image": "", "title": "Why Most AI Agent Projects Stall Before Production \u2014 and What the Ones That Ship Do Differently", "excerpt": "The gap between a working agent demo and a production deployment is an architecture problem, not a polish problem. Where projects stall in staging, and what it takes to ship one that runs reliably.", "category": "", "read_time": "17 min read"}, {"url": "/blog/hierarchical-multi-agent-orchestration-explained.html", "date": "Apr 23, 2026", "image": "", "title": "Hierarchical Multi-Agent Orchestration: How Supervisor-Worker Architectures Handle Real Production Workloads", "excerpt": "Supervisor-worker agent architectures behave differently under production load than in a notebook. What breaks \u2014 message routing, state, failure recovery \u2014 and how we run them on Kubernetes, Ka...", "category": "", "read_time": "21 min read"}, {"url": "/guides/llm-cost-calculator-guide.html", "date": "Apr 13, 2026", "image": "", "title": "Understanding LLM Provider Cost Comparison Calculator", "excerpt": "A practical guide to LLM Provider Cost Comparison Calculator \u2014 what it means, how it works, and how to use our interactive llm provider cost comparison calculator.", "category": "", "read_time": "13 min read"}, {"url": "/guides/ai-agent-roi-estimator-guide.html", "date": "Apr 5, 2026", "image": "", "title": "Understanding AI Agent ROI Estimator", "excerpt": "A practical guide to AI Agent ROI Estimator \u2014 what it means, how it works, and how to use our interactive ai agent roi estimator.", "category": "", "read_time": "15 min read"}, {"url": "/guides/tool-agent-complexity-estimator-guide.html", "date": "Apr 4, 2026", "image": "", "title": "Understanding Agent Architecture Complexity Estimator", "excerpt": "A practical guide to Agent Architecture Complexity Estimator \u2014 what it means, how it works, and how to use our interactive agent architecture complexity estimator.", "category": "", "read_time"